  <li><strong>Triple-Layer Fragile Protection:</strong> Glassware and ceramics are individually wrapped in bubble wrap, then padded with tissue paper, and finally secured in double-walled cardboard boxes. This layered approach absorbs 85% of impact forces during transit.</li>
